     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" data-account-id=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" accountid=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Branko Cicovic</a> <a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A1f21c3b6-c183-4d46-9561-7b79f0e197ab\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:1f21c3b6-c183-4d46-9561-7b79f0e197ab\" data-account-id=\"712020:1f21c3b6-c183-4d46-9561-7b79f0e197ab\" accountid=\"712020:1f21c3b6-c183-4d46-9561-7b79f0e197ab\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Milos Vasic</a> - take a look at this one. Branko and I discussed that only \u2018out of working hours\u2019 conflicts should have adjust option.</p>",
